{{!
    @template local_jedomi/local/sidebar/icon

    Inline SVG icon of the Jedomi sidebar. The context has one flag set to true: the name of the icon.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * icon object - One of these flags set to true: sparkle, trigger, newchat, export, close, mic, camera, attach, send, copy, thumbup, thumbdn, edit, chart, alert, ghost, clip, moon, users, shield, task, star, help, lock, cpu, plus, search, db, clipboard, gear, book, zap

    Example context (json):
    {
        "icon": {"chart": true}
    }
}}
